title: grid-diamondcutter-oss
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Eir Inc"
    affiliation: "Eir Inc"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eir-inc/grid-diamondcutter-oss"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, Apache-2.0 power-grid simulator and cycle-walk
  measurement framework. Implements the substrate-plugin contract +
  voices pattern + dual-scalar (closure_residual / path_excursion)
  cycle-walk measurement, with real PYPOWER `runpf` ingest for IEEE
  test cases (case14 / case30 / case118).
keywords:
  - power-grid
  - simulation
  - cycle-walk
  - stability-class
  - substrate-plugin
  - open-core
  - energy-grid
